### --- Sport annidati ---

### 400 - sportType che non esiste nell'enum SportType
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Lorenzo",
  "lastName": "Quaroni",
  "email": "bad.sport.{{$random.uuid}}@example.com",
  "password": "Str0ng!Passw0rd",
  "birthDate": "1999-04-23",
  "sports": [ { "sportType": "Judo", "yearsPracticed": 2, "isCompeting": false } ]
}

